---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description={`Terms governing use of the ${site.name} website, vehicle listings, pricing, sales and service.`}
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of this website (the "Site"),
    operated by {site.name}. By using the Site you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree,
    please do not use the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Use of the Site</h2>
  <p>You agree to use the Site lawfully. You must not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Interfere with, disrupt, or attempt to gain unauthorised access to the Site or its systems</li>
    <li>Scrape, harvest, or bulk-extract content or data from the Site</li>
    <li>Use the Site to transmit unlawful, misleading, or fraudulent content</li>
    <li>Reproduce, resell, or commercially exploit Site content without our written permission</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Vehicle Listings</h2>
  <p>
    Vehicle listings on the Site are provided for general information only and
    <strong>do not constitute an offer to sell</strong>. We reserve the right to correct errors and
    to change listings at any time.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Availability, price, specifications, equipment, mileage, and condition are subject to change
      without notice and may contain inaccuracies
    </li>
    <li>
      Photographs, illustrations, and colour renderings are representative only — the actual vehicle
      may differ in appearance, equipment, or condition
    </li>
    <li>
      Descriptions may rely on information supplied by third parties, including vehicle history
      reports. We do not independently warrant third-party data
    </li>
    <li>
      Prior use, prior repairs, paintwork, and accident history may exist even where not expressly
      described
    </li>
    <li>
      Prices shown exclude taxes, title, registration, documentation fees, and any other dealer fees
      unless expressly stated
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Independent Inspection</h2>
  <p>
    We encourage every buyer to arrange an independent pre-purchase inspection and to review all
    documents before completing a purchase. Used vehicles are sold
    <strong>"as is" unless a separate written warranty is provided</strong>. No oral statement
    creates a warranty.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Vehicle Sales</h2>
  <p>
    A vehicle sale is governed by a separate written purchase agreement signed by the parties, which
    controls in the event of any conflict with this Site. Odometer disclosure is provided as required
    by federal and applicable state law. Title transfer is subject to clear title and, where
    applicable, release of any existing lien.
  </p>

  <h2>5. FTC Buyer's Guide</h2>
  <p>
    Used vehicles offered for sale at our dealership are posted with the Federal Trade Commission
    Buyer's Guide, as required by the Used Motor Vehicle Trade Regulation Rule (16 C.F.R. Part 455).
    The Buyer's Guide is the definitive statement of warranty coverage for a specific vehicle and
    prevails over any general statement on this Site.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Service Appointments and Estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Service estimates given before inspection are preliminary. Additional work discovered during
    diagnosis requires your authorisation before it is performed. Warranty terms covering service
    work are provided to you in writing.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Shipping and Transport</h2>
  <p>If you ask us to arrange transport of a purchased vehicle, the following applies:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Transport is performed by independent, licensed, bonded and insured carriers.
      {site.name} acts as a coordinator and is not the carrier.
    </li>
    <li>
      Shipping quotes are estimates based on the information available at the time. Final cost may
      vary with route, fuel surcharges, access restrictions and scheduling.
    </li>
    <li>
      Delivery timeframes are estimates only and are not guaranteed. Weather, mechanical issues and
      other events may delay delivery.
    </li>
    <li>
      Risk of loss passes to you in accordance with the purchase agreement and the carrier's bill of
      lading.
    </li>
    <li>
      You must inspect the vehicle at delivery and note any damage on the bill of lading before
      signing. Transit-damage claims must be reported to us and the carrier promptly and are subject
      to the carrier's terms and coverage.
    </li>
    <li>
      Alaska, Hawaii and international shipments are subject to additional terms, fees and transit
      times.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
  <p>
    All content on the Site — including text, layout, graphics, logos, and the {site.name} name and
    marks — is owned by us or our licensors and is protected by copyright and trademark law. You may
    not use it without our prior written consent. Third-party marks are the property of their
    respective owners and are used for identification purposes only.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Disclaimers</h2>
  <p>
    THE SITE AND ITS CONTENT ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE," WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND,
    WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY, INCLUDING IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS
    FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. We do not warrant that the Site will be
    uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, {site.name} AND ITS OWNERS, EMPLOYEES, AND
    AGENTS WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR
    PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR FOR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, OR GOODWILL, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO
    YOUR USE OF THE SITE. Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations, so some of the above
    may not apply to you.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Indemnification</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to indemnify and hold harmless {site.name} and its personnel from any claims, damages,
    losses, or expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your misuse of the Site or
    your violation of these Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Governing Law and Venue</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to its conflict of
    law rules. Any dispute arising from these Terms or the Site will be brought exclusively in the
    state or federal courts located in Hernando County, Florida, and you consent to their jurisdiction.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these Terms at any time by posting an updated version on this page. Your continued
    use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>14. Severability and Entire Agreement</h2>
  <p>
    If any provision of these Terms is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full
    force. These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy and any signed purchase agreement, are the
    entire agreement between you and us regarding the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>15. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name}<br />
    {site.address}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
